var e={tool:`dumpcap from Wireshark`,download:`https://www.wireshark.org/download.html`,guide:`https://wiki.wireshark.org/CaptureSetup/CapturePrivileges`,setup:{windows:`Install Wireshark with dumpcap and the Npcap capture driver. Follow the installer’s capture-permission choices.`,darwin:`Install Wireshark and its ChmodBPF helper for capture permissions.`,linux:`Install your distribution’s dumpcap or Wireshark package and follow its capture-group permission setup.`},afterSetup:`Open Live capture to check interfaces and permissions. Reading an existing PCAP or PCAPNG file needs no Wireshark installation.`,notes:[`Capture requires installed dumpcap and OS permission; ProtoPeek does not install drivers or request elevation.`,`Packet-file reading is core; payload reconstruction is opt-in. Captured addresses and payloads can be private.`],route:`/network/packets`,openLabel:`Open live capture`};export{e as default};